WEBVTT

00:00.517 --> 00:04.465
What if a whole country's history fit on a single screen?

00:04.515 --> 00:05.705
Pick a saga.

00:05.785 --> 00:08.054
Every country is a journey.

00:08.104 --> 00:13.764
Hit play: the narration tells, the map flies, time runs.

00:13.814 --> 00:18.673
Choose the voice, the narration language, the speed and the captions.

00:18.723 --> 00:23.903
Drag the cursor to any year and hit play: the narration starts right there.

00:23.955 --> 00:27.135
Zoom into the timeline to see every decade.

00:27.187 --> 00:31.647
Switch to real scale and feel how vast prehistory is.

00:31.698 --> 00:36.318
Rearrange by theme or region, and see how much was happening at once.

00:36.368 --> 00:41.578
Follow a thread: wars, religion, economy, disasters.

00:41.628 --> 00:43.938
Every light on the map is an event.

00:44.038 --> 00:45.468
Click and read.

00:45.519 --> 00:51.579
Every event leads to others: connections, people, what came before and after.

00:51.629 --> 00:54.969
Follow a person and see the path they traveled.

00:55.019 --> 00:58.119
Click a region to see only what happened there.

00:58.169 --> 01:01.109
Zoom out and see the world around it.

01:01.159 --> 01:04.819
Show just the map, just the text, or both.

01:04.870 --> 01:07.970
Search people, places, words.

01:08.020 --> 01:12.800
In the index, filter, sort and pick exactly what to hear.

01:12.851 --> 01:16.191
Copy a link that opens exactly this view.

01:16.242 --> 01:19.261
In several languages, with more on the way.

01:19.311 --> 01:20.611
Now it's your turn.

01:20.711 --> 01:21.871
Pick a saga.
